    <string name="gate_why_intro">You have used this app for %1$s minutes in the current cycle. Clearing this gate unlocks the next five minutes. It does not reset your accumulated time, and it does not reduce the delay on scrolling. Within a cycle the delay only ever grows.</string>
    <string name="gate_why_terminal">You are past twenty minutes, so this gate will return every five minutes until the cycle resets.</string>
    <string name="gate_why_next">The next gate is at %1$s minutes.</string>
    <string name="gate_why_leaving">Pressing HOME or RECENTS will leave this screen. That pauses the gate rather than clearing it. The gate returns when you scroll again.</string>

